��i<?php exit; ?>a:2:{s:7:"content";O:8:"stdClass":24:{s:2:"ID";i:5343;s:11:"post_author";s:1:"1";s:9:"post_date";s:19:"2026-04-01 09:57:01";s:13:"post_date_gmt";s:19:"2026-04-01 09:57:01";s:12:"post_content";s:1193:"<ol class="blog-details__list"><li>Centralize auth, decentralize business logic</li><li>Expose RED metrics per route</li><li>Document breaking changes like product launches</li></ol><blockquote class="blog-details__blockquote"><p>Building for regulated environments means every design choice is tested against security, auditability, and long-term maintainability—not just feature velocity.</p></blockquote><p>If you are planning a similar initiative, start with a thin end-to-end slice, instrument it in production, and expand scope only when telemetry supports the next bet.</p><p>An API gateway is not a silver bullet; it is a traffic cop that must understand auth, throttling, and which services are allowed to fan out. Misconfigured gateways become single points of mystery latency.</p><figure class="blog-details__figure wp-block-image size-large"><img src="https://nsc.test/wp-content/themes/NSC-Software/frontend/build/img/blog6.webp" alt="API Gateway Patterns for Microservices — team collaboration" loading="lazy" width="1200" height="675" /></figure><p>We prefer policy-as-code, structured logging with correlation IDs, and clear ownership when a route spans multiple teams.</p>";s:10:"post_title";s:38:"API Gateway Patterns for Microservices";s:12:"post_excerpt";s:260:"API Gateway Patterns for Microservices — An API gateway is not a silver bullet; it is a traffic cop that must understand auth, throttling, and which services are allowed to fan out. Misconfigured gateways become single points of mystery latency. We prefer…";s:11:"post_status";s:7:"publish";s:14:"comment_status";s:4:"open";s:11:"ping_status";s:4:"open";s:13:"post_password";s:0:"";s:9:"post_name";s:38:"api-gateway-patterns-for-microservices";s:7:"to_ping";s:0:"";s:6:"pinged";s:0:"";s:13:"post_modified";s:19:"2026-04-01 09:57:01";s:17:"post_modified_gmt";s:19:"2026-04-01 09:57:01";s:21:"post_content_filtered";s:0:"";s:11:"post_parent";i:0;s:4:"guid";s:56:"https://nsc.test/api-gateway-patterns-for-microservices/";s:10:"menu_order";i:0;s:9:"post_type";s:4:"post";s:14:"post_mime_type";s:0:"";s:13:"comment_count";s:1:"0";s:6:"filter";s:3:"raw";}s:15:"key_version_all";i:1;}